<title>USA: True North CFO Ashwill resigns.</title>
<headline>True North CFO Ashwill resigns.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1997-02-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>True North Communications Inc said Thursday that Terry Ashwill, executive vice president, chief financial officer and a director, is leaving to join Perot Systems in Texas as chief financial officer.</p>
<p>True North, an advertising and marketing company, said Ashwill will remain with the company through March 5. A replacement has yet to be named.</p>
<p>	     ((Chicago newsdesk 312 408-8787))</p>
